// ZipNest app resources: the icon below is embedded so Explorer, taskbar,
// shortcuts and Alt-Tab all show the same image.
//
// The VERSIONINFO block lives in a separate resource file generated by
// build.rs ($OUT_DIR/zipnest_version.rc), because its version numbers come
// from CURRENT_VERSION in src/main.rs. Keep this file to the icon only so the
// two resource files never define the same resource ID.
1 ICON "src/assets/zipnest.ico"